    "name":  "iKinetic IK01 Kinetic Wireless Wall Switch RF433 - Battery-free - 1 / 2 / 3 Gang - Thin 86 Series - IP65 - Matt White",
    "reference":  "IK01",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSelf-powered wireless wall switch:\u003c/strong\u003e pressing the key generates the energy for the radio signal, so there is \u003cstrong\u003eno battery and no wiring\u003c/strong\u003e. Stick or screw it anywhere and pair it with iKinetic RF433 receivers (AR10, AR15, AR25, DD01, DD02, DD03).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThin 86-series design, IP65, matt white, available with 1, 2 or 3 keys - each key works independently.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eiKinetic IK01 Kinetic Switch | RF433 | Battery-free\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eNo battery, no wiring: the key press powers the transmitter.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEach key works independently and can control its own receiver or channel.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOn/off: press once. Dimming (on AR25 / DD dimmers): press twice to start the dimming cycle, press again to set the brightness.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOne receiver stores up to 10 switches; one switch can control several receivers.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIP65 - suitable for bathrooms and humid rooms.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePairing: see the receiver user manual.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTechnical data\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eModel\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eIK01-1G-WH / IK01-2G-WH / IK01-3G-WH\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eType\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eKinetic (self-powered) wireless switch\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRadio frequency\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRF433MHz\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePower supply\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eNone - kinetic energy from the key press\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eKeys\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e1 / 2 / 3\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSeries\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThin 86\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eProtection\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eIP65\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eColour\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMatt white\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCompatible receivers\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eiKinetic AR10, AR15, AR25, DD01, DD02, DD03\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e",
